    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d80">

                <pb facs="0090" n="80" sameAs="frus:frus1941v06/pg80"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Pacific War/1107</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-09">December 9, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ambassador of Colombia<anchor n="38" xml:id="d80-f1"/> called at his request
                    and handed me a note, copy attached,<anchor n="39" xml:id="d80-f2"/> setting
                    forth the strong spirit of cooperation on the part of Colombia in defense of
                    this hemisphere. The Ambassador emphasized the keen interest his Government felt
                    in taking this course and its earnest desire to continue to cooperate in every
                    way contemplated by the Habana and other preceding conferences.</p>
                <p>I thanked him very profusely and emphasized our deep appreciation of this fine
                    spirit of alert cooperation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
